      "finding_id": "v12_best_local_but_still_noisy",
      "finding": "Component-residual guard v12 is the local H1y winner at 7/10 exact and 7/10 executor-equivalent, a +0.200 exact-rate delta over v11. It still only reaches 1/2 on surface-value holdouts, so broad residual wording keeps the old transfer risk alive."
    },
